{"1":{"step":[[1,2,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/heiping.jpg","choice":[]},"2":{"step":[[2,5,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/dubaiyongheiping.jpg","choice":[]},"71":{"step":[[71,10,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_jianyu.jpg","choice":[]},"5":{"step":[[5,6,""]],"type":1,"name":["德洛丝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"518501.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["<i>迄今，我已作为亲历者参与了“美洲诗社”的数次集会。</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"6":{"step":[[6,7,""]],"type":1,"name":["德洛丝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"518501.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["<i>那些文学实验将文字视为一种高级的游戏，将现实与虚构交织成一道无形的网，把在场的所有人紧紧捕捉在这语言的迷宫里。</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"7":{"step":[[7,8,""]],"type":1,"name":["德洛丝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"518501.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["<i>在此之前，我从未如此近距离地接触、思考文学，我为文字与语言在趣味性和价值性上有如此直观的表现力而感到惊叹。</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"8":{"step":[[8,9,""]],"type":1,"name":["德洛丝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"518511.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["<i>直到那个寻常的午后，名叫爱德华多的诗人正以考究的节奏朗诵着自己的新作，奥克塔维奥小姐在与我交谈圣保罗的社会现状。</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"9":{"step":[[9,71,""]],"type":1,"name":["德洛丝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"518511.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["<i>没有人察觉到胡利奥先生的异常。</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"10":{"step":[[10,11,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["就像您在《圣保罗锌皮兵》里写就的那般——","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"11":{"step":[[11,12,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<i>“伟大的拉丁美洲因富庶而遭受不幸，又因不幸而被不知餍足的贪欲撕咬。一个人的贫穷是另一个人的盛宴，苦难滋养着幸福，它们就像河的两岸，泾渭分明。”</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"12":{"step":[[12,13,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这种两面性，这种两难的境界，不正是我们应该用文学去提出的问题——","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_jianyu.jpg","choice":[]},"13":{"step":[[13,14,""]],"type":2,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["骨骼与硬物碰撞的闷响从不远处传来，打断了她的话题。<br>不远处，正在用头撞墙的男人吸引了在场所有人的注意力。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_jianyu.jpg","choice":[]},"14":{"step":[[14,15,""]],"type":1,"name":["胡利奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"519801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["还不够……还不够！这种程度、是没法、抓住、空间和时间的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_jianyu.jpg","choice":[]},"15":{"step":[[15,16,""]],"type":1,"name":["胡利奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"519801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["我还缺少、某些必要的、语言体系、和思维……！！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_jianyu.jpg","choice":[]},"16":{"step":[[16,17,""]],"type":1,"name":["胡利奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"519801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["以我们目前的、语言体系、来说，我没有办法、抓住、时间的幽灵，只能、任由它、从我的笔尖、流逝……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"17":{"step":[[17,18,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["胡利奥先生，您这是怎么了？！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"18":{"step":[[18,19,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["同紧张的奥克塔维奥相比，胡利奥四周的囚犯都显得无动于衷。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"19":{"step":[[19,20,""]],"type":1,"name":["囚犯Ⅳ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那是不可逾越的高墙，胡利奥……我早就告诉过你了。看在诗歌的份上，我可以把上周领的绷带借你一点儿。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"20":{"step":[[20,21,""]],"type":1,"name":["囚犯Ⅳ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["对于一个永久沉默的对象，任何形式的诉说都是一场徒劳。到最后，你只是在和自己的影子较劲。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"21":{"step":[[21,22,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612601746","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你们……在干什么？为什么不阻止胡利奥？！不行，我得做些什么……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"22":{"step":[[22,23,""]],"type":2,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["面对慌张的青年女性，医生知道，她需要先尽可能排除可能干扰施救的外部因素。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_jianyu.jpg","choice":[]},"23":{"step":[[23,24,""]],"type":1,"name":["德洛丝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"518512.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["奥克塔维奥小姐，请你先冷静下来。告诉我，在你眼中的世界发生了什么？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"24":{"step":[[24,25,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612601747","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["啊，对不起！是胡利奥先生……他……他流血了！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"25":{"step":[[25,26,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["他试图用头撞破语言边界的镜子……但那其实是一堵墙！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"26":{"step":[[26,27,""]],"type":2,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["如今，医生已经学会了如何忽视诗社成员们特有的非现实修饰，以正确理解现状。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"27":{"step":[[27,28,""]],"type":2,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["——镜子还是墙？那不重要。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"28":{"step":[[28,29,""]],"type":1,"name":["德洛丝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"518501.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["请你仔细观察一下，并尽可能不带修饰地告知我：胡利奥先生的状态如何？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"29":{"step":[[29,30,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……他的肌肉在不住地痉挛，如同被一股冰冷的电流击中；他的面部开始紧绷、扭曲，仿佛在与一场无声的斗争抗衡；他的手指也蜷曲成不自然的姿势……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"30":{"step":[[30,31,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["他的表情正在反复地变化……先是痛苦，然后是惊恐，最后是茫然……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"31":{"step":[[31,32,""]],"type":1,"name":["德洛丝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"518510.png","audio":"612601725","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["初步判断，那应该是某种脑部的神经疾病……如果是癫痫，我想我可以帮到他。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"32":{"step":[[32,33,""]],"type":2,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["医生循着声音的方向，接近了头破血流的胡利奥。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"33":{"step":[[33,34,""]],"type":1,"name":["德洛丝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"518501.png","audio":"612601729","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["奥克塔维奥小姐，我需要你的帮助。你能让他先停止自我伤害的动作，并尽可能躺在平地上保持侧卧吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"34":{"step":[[34,35,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我、我可以用我的神秘术帮上忙……！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"35":{"step":[[35,36,""]],"type":1,"name":["德洛丝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"518512.png","audio":"612601726","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["奥克塔维奥小姐，你的神秘术会伴随强光吗？我想你现在不能使用它，否则会起到截然相反的效果——刺激性的光源会让癫痫更加严重。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"36":{"step":[[36,37,""]],"type":2,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["奥克塔维奥慌张地收起了术式。<br>她按住胡利奥的肩膀，以蛮力将其放置于冰冷而坚硬的地面。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"37":{"step":[[37,72,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["医生迅速跪下，将男子轻轻侧卧，防止他在抽搐中撞伤。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"38":{"step":[[38,39,""]],"type":1,"name":["德洛丝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"518511.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["<i>随着时间的推移，胡利奥先生的抽搐逐渐减弱，但身体依旧僵硬，牙关紧闭。<br>我从医疗箱中取出一次性舌垫，小心地放入他的口腔中，防止他咬伤自己。</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"39":{"step":[[39,40,""]],"type":1,"name":["德洛丝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"518511.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["<i>情况逐渐得到了控制，胡利奥先生的呼吸逐渐趋于平稳。</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"40":{"step":[[40,73,""]],"type":1,"name":["德洛丝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"518511.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["<i>大家重新开始了集会，似乎这只是一个无关紧要的小小插曲。</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"41":{"step":[[41,42,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["谢谢您的出手援助，兀尔德女士。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"42":{"step":[[42,77,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["医生以一个无声的微笑作答。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"43":{"step":[[43,44,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612601748","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["您在圣保罗也经常做这样的事情，对吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"44":{"step":[[44,45,""]],"type":1,"name":["德洛丝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"518510.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["是的。救助他人才是我的本职，而写作是我的一份爱好。在我的那座小屋里，在每一位病人面前，我首先是一名医生。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"45":{"step":[[45,46,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["兀尔德女士，我对您感到由衷的敬佩。无论是身为医生、身为作家，还是身为一个社会身份之前的人。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"46":{"step":[[46,47,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["作为一个真正在河岸贫民区生活的医生，您在将文字作为武器之前，首先将枪口对准了自己。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"47":{"step":[[47,48,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["与您相比，我不仅没能取得什么像样的成就，还时常因为将理想挂在嘴边……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"48":{"step":[[48,49,""]],"type":1,"name":["德洛丝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"518501.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["奥克塔维奥小姐，我这一类兴致使然的写作者，也许无法为你提供具体的帮助与建议，也远没有你说的那般伟大。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"49":{"step":[[49,50,""]],"type":1,"name":["德洛丝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"518510.png","audio":"612601727","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["但至少，我相信一点：于你的文学理想而言，自我审视是必要的一环，而你正好拥有这项宝贵的品德。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"50":{"step":[[50,51,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612601750","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["好的……无论如何，谢谢您。我想回自己的房间思索一会儿，明天见！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"51":{"step":[[51,74,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/heiping.jpg","choice":[]},"52":{"step":[[52,53,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["理想家所追求的理想，是在文学大厦上造就一座伟大的景观。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"53":{"step":[[53,54,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但是，对于大厦之外的人们来说，那份伟大又能带来什么呢？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"54":{"step":[[54,55,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["眼下，我被关在监狱里，我的文字没法从这个边缘之地传达出去，就连保命都要靠我那面目可憎的父亲。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"55":{"step":[[55,56,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612601749","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["也许……用信念来疗愈病灶是愚昧的；也许，我们与中世纪那些被焚烧的异教徒并无区别。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"56":{"step":[[56,57,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["也许……只有像兀尔德女士这样具有专业素养的医生，才能拯救具体的人。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"57":{"step":[[57,58,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["等会儿……这座监狱的确有一个医生，一个用来应对所有问题的医生，而精神领域正是他的专业。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"58":{"step":[[58,59,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["可他不仅仅是个医生——他还是这座监狱的实际管理者！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"59":{"step":[[59,60,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我曾问过理想家先生，为什么这里的管理者不是典狱长或警署，而是一位狱医。不出所料，他用那套厉害的理想式话术糊弄了我。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"60":{"step":[[60,61,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但为什么理想家先生一直那样抵触狱医呢？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"61":{"step":[[61,62,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612601751","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["为什么……不能将胡利奥先生这样饱受折磨的病患送到他那儿去？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"62":{"step":[[62,63,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612601752","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我不明白……不明白的事情越来越多了。我的头好疼……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"63":{"step"